      "machineHash": "44eee894fa35a843c6dca740805f175fa1e3b3407a7477c7f27da83e633e5fb6",
      "machineText": "*需要主动启用。*实验绝不会改变`wails3`的默认行为。你需要有意启用它们（通常通过环境变量或构建标志）；关闭它们后，你现有的工作流程不会发生任何变化。",
      "status": "final",
      "sourcePreview": "*It's opt-in.* Experiments never change the default behaviour of `wails3`. You turn them on delibera…",
      "provider": "codex",
